# Build context is Backend/ (services share ../config), so keep it lean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/sample.env
**/npm-debug.log*
# NOTE: do NOT exclude "**/logs" — several services keep *source* in directories
# named logs (desktop/src/logs/Logger.js, admin/src/routes/v3/logs/). Excluding
# log *files* by extension is enough.
**/*.log
**/public/uploads
**/public/images
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
# Stray absolute-Windows-path log dir the productivity_report logger creates
**/D:\\*
